重要聲明 · Important Notice
--------------------------------------------------------------------

本授權**並非**官方 GNU General Public License v3（GPLv3）文本。GPLv3
第 7 條規定，「額外條款」僅限特定幾類（例如姓名標示、免責聲明調整
等），並不允許附加「限制商業使用」或「要求修改幅度」這類條款。因此
本授權僅是**參考 GPLv3 的著佐權（copyleft）精神**——即「散布的副本
必須公開對應原始碼」——所自行撰寫的獨立授權文字，並非 GPLv3 本身，
也未獲 FSF 背書，不應被稱為「GPLv3」或與其混淆。

This license is **not** the official GNU General Public License v3
(GPLv3) text. GPLv3 Section 7 restricts "additional terms" to a
specific short list (e.g. attribution, warranty disclaimers) and does
not permit terms that limit commercial use or require a certain degree
of modification. This license is therefore an independently written
license that borrows GPLv3's core copyleft principle — that conveyed
copies must come with corresponding source code — but is not GPLv3
itself, is not endorsed by the FSF, and should not be referred to or
confused with "GPLv3."

